            "review_title": "Review at Moo:d Kafé",
            "review_text": "Lo. P\n54 contributions\n0\nSoft Sip, Sweet Bite\nSep 2025 • Friends\nVietnamese coffee always has its own charm, and every shop I’ve tried feels unique in its own way.\n\nThis place is one of my favorites the coffee is light and easy to drink, not too strong, perfect for anyone who enjoys a smooth, relaxing cup without the rush.\n\nAs for the croissant, it’s filled just right. Nothing too fancy, but surprisingly tastier than I expected the kind that makes you keep wanting another bite.\n\nIf you ever get the chance to visit, I’d really recommend stopping by and giving it a try.\nRead more\nWritten September 24, 2025",
